# Cloudflare Pages reads this instead of netlify.toml.
#
# Invite and unsubscribe links are real paths and must reach the app
# rather than 404. Pages falls back to the shell on its own when there
# is no 404.html, but saying so out loud is cheaper than finding out.
# /api/* needs no rule: a Pages Function file serves its own path.
/join/*         /index.html  200
/unsubscribe/*  /index.html  200
